#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Features/Extend/UI/SmartSettingsFormWidget_Extend.cpp(35)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,ExtendPanel_Help"
msgid "Select Source arms one world click outside the window; Escape cancels it. The source stays in place. Smart copies supported connected buildings, belts, pipes, lifts, supports and power. Use the placement controls below for copies, rows, layers and transforms. Normal placement rules and costs apply. Apply updates the preview; close the Panel and build normally. Hovering the same building with the matching recipe remains a shortcut. Restore > Modules can save the captured layout."
msgstr "Seleccionar fuente habilita un clic en el mundo fuera de la ventana; Esc lo cancela. La fuente permanece en su lugar. Smart copia edificios conectados compatibles, cintas, tuberías, cintas elevadoras, soportes y electricidad. Usa los controles de colocación de abajo para copias, filas, capas y transformaciones. Se aplican las reglas y costes de colocación normales. Aplicar actualiza la vista previa; cierra el panel y construye normalmente. Pasar el cursor sobre el mismo edificio con la receta coincidente sigue siendo un atajo. Restaurar > Módulos puede guardar el diseño capturado."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Features/Extend/UI/SmartSettingsFormWidget_Extend.cpp(215)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,ExtendPanel_HoverSource"
msgid "Compatible source: {0}. Click to select; Escape cancels."
msgstr "Fuente compatible: {0}. Haz clic para seleccionar; Esc cancela."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Features/Extend/UI/SmartSettingsFormWidget_Extend.cpp(138)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,ExtendPanel_Miss"
msgid "No compatible source selected. Hold the same building type and enable Extend in settings. Your previous preview is retained."
msgstr "No se ha seleccionado ninguna fuente compatible. Mantén el mismo tipo de edificio y activa Extensión en la configuración. Tu vista previa anterior se conserva."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Features/Extend/UI/SmartSettingsFormWidget_Extend.cpp(91)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,ExtendPanel_NoSource"
msgid "No source selected. Equip the matching factory building, then select the existing module to copy."
msgstr "No hay fuente seleccionada. Equipa el edificio de fábrica coincidente, luego selecciona el módulo existente para copiar."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Features/Extend/UI/SmartSettingsFormWidget_Extend.cpp(55)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,ExtendPanel_PickHint"
msgid "Select a source, or close the Panel and aim at it with the matching building equipped."
msgstr "Selecciona una fuente, o cierra el panel y apúntale con el edificio coincidente equipado."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Features/Extend/UI/SmartSettingsFormWidget_Extend.cpp(119)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,ExtendPanel_Ready"
